# Pay3 environment variables

## Neon PostgreSQL (required for persistent storage)

See **`docs/DATABASE.md`** for full setup.

```env
# Pooled — app runtime (-pooler in hostname)
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@ep-xxxx-pooler.region.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require

# Direct — Prisma db push / migrations (no -pooler)
DIRECT_URL=postgresql://user:pass@ep-xxxx.region.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require
```

Copy into **`packages/database/.env`** and **`apps/api/.env`**.

## API (`apps/api`)

```env
PORT=4000
WEB_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000
NODE_ENV=development
DATABASE_URL=...
DIRECT_URL=...
```

## Web (`apps/web`)

```env
# Same-origin proxy to the API (keeps login cookies across refresh)
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=/api
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
NEXT_PUBLIC_STELLAR_NETWORK=Test SDF Network ; September 2015
```

Optional: `API_PROXY_ORIGIN=http://localhost:4000` if the API runs elsewhere (used by Next rewrites).
